{"resourceIdentifier":"4443","resourceName":"Jinan Pingyin Youran Dairy Cattle Manure Management Project","description":"Jinan Pingyin Youran Dairy Cattle Manure Management Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) locates in South of Qianwa Village, Xiaozhi Town, Pingyin County, Jinan City, Shandong Province, P.R China.\r\nThe project builds an anaerobic animal manure treatment system for the treatment of dairy cattle manure in Jinan Pingyin Youran Pasture. The project uses animal manure waste as ferment material to produce biogas in the Completely Stirred Tank Reactor (CSTR) type anaerobic digesters. The recovered biogas will be used for electricity generation at the biogas power plant. According to the feasibility study report, the designed installed capacity of the biogas power plant is 0.8MW. The electricity generated by the biogas power plant will be used by the Project itself. Waste heat recovery boiler will also be installed at the biogas power plant to recover and supply waste heat to the auxiliary equipment of the project.\r\nPrior to the implementation of the project, the animal manure waste was left to decay in anaerobic manure management system (lagoon) at the livestock farms and methane is emitted to the atmosphere directly without any methane recovery and destruction facility. The project is expected to avoid GHG emission of methane through recovery and destruction of biogas.","location":{"latitude":36.078333,"longitude":116.522221},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-07-05","endExclusive":"2023-08-05","endInclusive":"2023-08-04"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4443"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shandong"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jinan Youran Animal Husbandry Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Shandong Province, China"},{"typ